Paid plans. The plugin is on the account: every device signed in to it gets it.

+ Sidebar: *Plugins* → *Add* → *Add custom MCP server*

  #image("assets/chatgpt_plugins_add.png")
+ Name: `Service Arb`, or your own. Description: what it covers, so ChatGPT knows when to use it. URL: `https://sa.evinvest.ltd/playbook_mcp`. Authentication: *OAuth*. Tick *I understand and want to continue*, then *Create as a plugin*, and sign in.

  #image("assets/chatgpt_custom_mcp.png", width: 50%)

Sign in again: *Connect* on the plugin.
